        <mxCell id="c120" value="&lt;i&gt;The Checks tab of the model answer after Home &gt; Refresh and Run, scrolled to twelve of the 41 rows of Exercise 14.4: Furniture&#x27;s bridge for 2026-Q4 and the first rows of Lighting&#x27;s. The query returns 331 rows in all. Long lines of the query run off the editor&#x27;s edge, and values are written to the cent. Outlined: Agrees, true in every row.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="650" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
